#   doomgeneric is a minimal porting layer around the classic Doom engine:
#   it renders into a single 32-bit framebuffer (DG_ScreenBuffer) and hands
#   it to a tiny platform backend.  FreeLinX uses the `linuxvt` backend
#   (doomgeneric_linuxvt.c) which pushes the frame to the Linux framebuffer
#   device /dev/fb0 and reads input from evdev.
